le=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This intricate wristwatch is powered by some unseen magical energy, and contains intriciate detail that belies incredible worth. Its glass face is shattered, and although you've tried your best to clean it, dried blood lingers in the cracks.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>This <a href=\"/page/Minor_Artifact\" title=\"Minor Artifact\">Minor Artifact</a> has a maximum of 3 filigree slots.\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>minor bug: </b> There is a typo in the description: intriciate</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817203641\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.101 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.172 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4523/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33550/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11418/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  149.158      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  149.158      1 -total\n 97.00%  144.689      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 93.90%  140.062     64 Template:IO\n 32.01%   47.739      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 31.28%   46.658      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 30.05%   44.817      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 28.37%   42.312      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.92%   32.700     10 Template:Popup\n 13.51%   20.148      3 Template:Augment\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:76812-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817203641 and revision id 629585. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
